nimate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really? I was not aware of this.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-river-of-death-promethean-the-created/\" target=\"_blank\">Then you haven't been paying attention.</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Doesn't really invalidate my thought there, but I really did not expect that. </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-freaks-come-out-at-night-centimani-promethean-the-created/\" target=\"_blank\">Cobalus and Phosphorum</a> both amply cover the &quot;study nasty business to avoid it later on&quot; and &quot;embrace mortality to learn Mortality&quot; aspects being discussed. <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-freaks-come-out-at-night-centimani-promethean-the-created/\" target=\"_blank\">Flux-as-philosophy</a> is not particularly good for either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T13:55:30-07:00","id":502143,"title":"","content":"In particular, Cobalus is still about becoming human. The whole point of this thread is to come up with alternatives to the Refinements that are explicitly <i>not</i> about becoming human. For instance, I could perhaps see the goal of Corrupted Mercurius to be a final transformation where the Promethean leaves its body behind and becomes a creature composed entirely of Pyros, not unlike a <i>qashmal</i>. I'm not sure that it's doable for every Refinement, though; Aurum and Stannum in particular look like they'd take a lot of creativity to rework as Corruptions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}